[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734097512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104321#issuecomment-2734097512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104321","id":2734097512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i9wRo","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T17:16:57Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T17:17:06Z","body":"> Setting get_tree().root.title still works, but adds the \"(DEBUG)\" after the title, meaning there's no way to get rid of it for debug builds.\n\nThis was done by design: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/33148\n\nI acknowledge it takes some space, but it's important information to know even if you are customizing the window title (since it has a large performance impact).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734097512/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2866968708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104321#issuecomment-2866968708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104321","id":2866968708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6q4niE","user":{"login":"Warrior555MainsGanon","id":61848813,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODQ4ODEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61848813?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon","html_url":"https://github.com/Warrior555MainsGanon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Warrior555MainsGanon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T15:20:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T15:20:46Z","body":"> The 4.4 update seems to have broken the DisplayServer.window_set_title function, in 4.3 it would change the title of the window, but in 4.4 it doesn't.\n\nFor correction, window_set_title still works on 4.4 unless called immediatly at/during startup (ex. with a func _ready); if called anywhere else at runtime, it will work as intended.\nDelaying window_set_title with a short await timeout works on 4.4.1 as a quick and dirty workaround:\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(0.1).timeout\n\tDisplayServer.window_set_title(\"sample window title\")```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2866968708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3635229650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104321#issuecomment-3635229650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104321","id":3635229650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YrTPS","user":{"login":"Remixful","id":8620268,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjAyNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8620268?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful","html_url":"https://github.com/Remixful","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Remixful/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T03:45:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T03:45:05Z","body":"> > The 4.4 update seems to have broken the DisplayServer.window_set_title function, in 4.3 it would change the title of the window, but in 4.4 it doesn't.\n> \n> For correction, window_set_title still works on 4.4 unless called immediatly at/during startup (ex. with a func _ready); if called anywhere else at runtime, it will work as intended. Delaying window_set_title with a short await timeout works on 4.4.1 as a quick and dirty workaround:\n> \n> ```\n> func _ready() -> void:\n> \tawait get_tree().create_timer(0.1).timeout\n> \tDisplayServer.window_set_title(\"sample window title\")```\n> ```\n\nTried this and it does not work if the window is embedded + floating.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3635229650/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5364978582","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104321#issuecomment-5364978582","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104321","id":5364978582,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP8cTlg","user":{"login":"lexum0","id":2546522,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDY1MjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2546522?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0","html_url":"https://github.com/lexum0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T03:52:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T03:52:47Z","body":"> > Setting get_tree().root.title still works, but adds the \"(DEBUG)\" after the title, meaning there's no way to get rid of it for debug builds.\n> \n> This was done by design: [#33148](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/33148)\n> \n> I acknowledge it takes some space, but it's important information to know even if you are customizing the window title (since it has a large performance impact).\n\nIt should allow overriding the value. \nThat was the case with using DisplayServer. `get_window().title` would show (DEBUG) and using `DisplayServer.window_set_title()` would allow overriding it. We should have both options available\n\nI’m trying to change the window title with`DisplayServer.window_set_title()` and it’s not working at all on Godot 4.7.2 on macOS 26","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5364978582/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]